{
    "title": "Radio Garden",
    "description": "Welcome to the one and only official version of Radio Garden!\r\n\r\nRadio Garden allows you to listen to thousands of live radio stations world wide by rotating the globe.\r\n\r\nEvery green dot represents a city or town. Tap on it to tune into the radio stations broadcasting from that city.\r\n\r\nBy adding new stations every day and updating ones that no longer work, we hope to give you a smooth international radio listening experience.\r\n\r\nSave your favourite stations for later listening.\r\n\r\nDon't worry: the radio will keep playing, even if your phone goes to sleep.\r\n\r\nMore features coming soon.\r\n\r\nMuch love,\r\nRadio Garden",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the one and only official version of Radio Garden!<br><br>Radio Garden allows you to listen to thousands of live radio stations world wide by rotating the globe.<br><br>Every green dot represents a city or town. Tap on it to tune into the radio stations broadcasting from that city.<br><br>By adding new stations every day and updating ones that no longer work, we hope to give you a smooth international radio listening experience.<br><br>Save your favourite stations for later listening.<br><br>Don&#39;t worry: the radio will keep playing, even if your phone goes to sleep.<br><br>More features coming soon.<br><br>Much love,<br>Radio Garden",
